WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.100
Welcome back to the workshop.

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.500
Today we are building a small bridge.

3
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.900
First, measure the gap twice.

4
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.300
Then cut the beams to length.

5
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.700
Keep the saw blade straight.

6
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.100
Sand every edge before you glue it.

7
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.500
The glue needs ten minutes to set.

8
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.900
Meanwhile, let us prepare the deck.

9
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.300
Lay the planks side by side.

10
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.700
Leave a small gap between them.

11
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.100
Wood moves when the weather changes.

12
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.500
Now fix the deck to the beams.

13
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.900
Check that the bridge is level.

14
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.300
Add a coat of oil for protection.

15
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:36.700
Let it dry overnight.

16
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.100
See you next time.

